sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User/CLI
    participant Main as "CLI Orchestrator (app/cli/main.py)"
    participant Registry as "Parser Factory (get_parser)"
    participant Parser as "Parser (BaseParser Subclass)"
    participant Event as LogEvent Model
    
    User->>Main: Runs cli build with sources.yaml
    Main->>Main: Load configuration YAML
    loop For each source in configuration
        Main->>Registry: get_parser(format, source_name, timezone, pattern)
        Registry->>Parser: Instantiate corresponding parser subclass
        Registry-->>Main: Return parser instance
        Main->>Main: Read source log file (line by line or stream)
        loop For each line/record
            Main->>Parser: parse(raw_line, line_number)
            Parser->>Event: Instantiate LogEvent (timezone normalized to UTC)
            Event-->>Parser: Return LogEvent
            Parser-->>Main: Return LogEvent
            Main->>Main: Append to events list
        end
    end
    Main->>Main: Sort all events by timestamp (chronological)
    Main->>Main: Format output JSON (timeline & stats)
    Main-->>User: Output JSON to stdout
